          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishorua Olaitoriani enkisiligata ajo keitajeu Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entoomon Olaitoriani enchan te nkata oloirujuruj, Olaitoriani ninye oitobiru olkutati o nkatampo, naa ninye oisho iltung'ana enkirujuruj e nchan, neitonyorij pooki toki tiong'ota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eikilikuanishore iltung'ana nkitanyaanyukot o laitumusumusok kake ore iwalat naatum naa elejare o emodai. Eibelekeny kulikae nkidetidetat neitapong'oo intae. Enepesho enkikoo enye. Neaku kelimana iltung'ana anaa ntare naaimina. Etii ninche atua enyamali amu meeta olarikoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eirowuaja engoro ai tenkaraki lelo shekuti, naa kaitame nanu lelo arikok; amu kegolie Olaitoriani loo lororani eluata enye ina aji e Yuda. Eketiu ninche anaa imbartan aainei naagol o larrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atua ninche epukunye ilaitoriak, o larikok o lkituaak ooitore iltung'ana laainei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki tenebo naa keaku iltung'ana magil to larrabal, eitunyoki ilmang'ati lenye atua esarng'ab",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "esarng'ab",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "osordo",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " oo nkoitoi naalala; naa kearisho ninche amu etii Olaitoriani tenebo ninche, naa kemir ninche lelo akedok loo mbartan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaitagol iltung'ana le Yuda;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
